                            "last_played": 1686805791
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The best SAO game visually, but ruined by a dead multiplayer and cheaters.\n\nPros:\n• Hands down the best SAO game ever made in terms of design and graphics. It looks absolutely stunning.\n• Fun Co-op (PvE): The multiplayer is actually great if you stick to PvE. If you get matched with a cheater, they can carry you through tough raids easily.\n\nCons:\n• Dead Servers: The multiplayer is practically a ghost town, with only 1 to 3 players online.\n• Broken PvP: Don't even bother with PvP. Between the rampant cheaters and broken damage scaling—where my DLC character only deals 10% of the damage other players do—it is completely unplayable.\nVerdict: Great for solo play and casual PvE co-op, but stay far away from PvP.\n",
